- It is.

1058
00:50:06,086 --> 00:50:08,587
- I'm glad.
- I've never done this.

1059
00:50:08,588 --> 00:50:10,506
- Looking good.
- Oh, it's pretty.

1060
00:50:10,507 --> 00:50:12,466
<i>Looks great. They're having a blast.</i>

1061
00:50:12,467 --> 00:50:14,677
