as a team since I was little.

1085
00:51:15,781 --> 00:51:17,031
Oh, I see.

1086
00:51:17,032 --> 00:51:21,410
My father couldn't accept the fact that
I didn't want to play baseball anymore.

1087
00:51:21,411 --> 00:51:22,328
I see.

1088
00:51:22,329 --> 00:51:25,749
And he didn't know that I was
doing all kinds of crazy things outside.

1089
00:51:27,084 --> 00:51:29,460
That was your father's dream.
He wanted you to play baseball.

1090
00:51:29,461 --> 00:51:30,670
Yeah, that's right.

1091
00:51:32,631 --> 00:51:34,799
For your father's sake, and for yours…

1092
00:51:34,800 --> 00:51:35,800
Uh-huh.

1093
00:51:35,801 --> 00:51:37,843
I hope the day will come
when you can cut his hair.

1094
00:51:37,844 --> 00:51:39,262
- Yeah, I hope so.
- So do I.

1095
00:51:41,139 --> 00:51:44,768
Lately, I have been thinking
about how I can make up with him.

1096
00:51:46,353 --> 00:51:49,438
For now, you'll just keep doing
what you're doing.

1097
00:51:49,439 --> 00:51:52,525
Just keep doing your best
as long as you can.

1098
00:51:52,526 --> 00:51:53,442
You're right.

1099
00:51:53,443 --> 00:51:57,405
