your best, he'll understand someday.

1100
00:51:57,989 --> 00:51:59,366
- Yeah, you're right.
- Mmm-hmm.

1101
00:52:00,909 --> 00:52:03,828
Just a little more hair spray,
and Ma-kun will be ready

1102
00:52:03,829 --> 00:52:05,579
- to take a job as a host.
