- Became a host?

1104
00:52:07,624 --> 00:52:09,292
- He will become a host.
- No way.

1105
00:52:10,335 --> 00:52:11,752
- Here he is!
- Hello.

1106
00:52:11,753 --> 00:52:14,046
- The number one host.
- What do you think?

1107
00:52:14,047 --> 00:52:16,799
The number one host!

1108
00:52:16,800 --> 00:52:18,092
Whoa!

1109
00:52:18,093 --> 00:52:20,678
Oh, you look so cool!
Make the pose, like "ta-da!"

1110
00:52:20,679 --> 00:52:22,180
Oh, he looks so cool!

1111
00:52:23,473 --> 00:52:26,601
- Tai-chan is really skilled.
- Tai-chan is amazing!

1112
00:52:30,397 --> 00:52:31,606
Everyone, look at this.

1113
00:52:33,191 --> 00:52:34,733
