- This is for you.

1114
00:52:34,734 --> 00:52:36,694
We made a bench.

1115
00:52:36,695 --> 00:52:39,530
- All of us together.
- Wow!

1116
00:52:39,531 --> 00:52:42,700
So, we all got to visit
Grandma Higa's amazing place.

1117
00:52:42,701 --> 00:52:46,203
It was a place that has a great view,
so we all wanted to put a bench there.

1118
00:52:46,204 --> 00:52:49,248
- Oh, thank you!
- Something to remember us by.

1119
00:52:49,249 --> 00:52:51,375
And we all wrote our names on it.

1120
00:52:51,376 --> 00:52:54,712
So, once Ms. Higa and everyone else
signs it, it'll be complete.

1121
00:52:54,713 --> 00:52:56,130
- How wonderful
- Yes.

1122
00:52:56,131 --> 00:52:57,883
Ms. Higa, write your name.

1123
00:53:00,260 --> 00:53:02,011
Check out that signature!

1124
00:53:02,012 --> 00:53:04,389
Oh my gosh!

1125
00:53:05,265 --> 00:53:06,891
That's so cool!

1126
00:53:06,892 --> 00:53:08,976
<i>Everyone from Okinawa is so lovely.</i>

1127
00:53:08,977 --> 00:53:11,437
<i>Okinawan grandpas and grandmas are cool.</i>

1128
00:53:11,438 --> 00:53:12,646
MA-CHAN FROM BUNAGAYA

1129
00:53:12,647 --> 00:53:14,732
A-SA KOMACHI
AZAMA

1130
00:53:14,733 --> 00:53:17,277
HARU-CHAN
EMIKO - KAZUO

1131
00:53:23,867 --> 00:53:26,786
<i>Oh, Rinrin looks like
she's having mixed feelings.</i>

1132
00:53:29,414 --> 00:53:30,457
Oh, wow.

1133
00:53:31,249 --> 00:53:32,959
It's different from the daytime.

1134
00:53:33,627 --> 00:53:35,378
Kamaken is really stupid.

1135
00:53:36,463 --> 00:53:37,922
- Yeah.
- It's so lame.

1136
00:53:37,923 --> 00:53:40,425
He's a 30-year-old grown man.
What an idiot.

1137
00:53:42,135 --> 00:53:43,887
But, well, it's the last day.

1138
00:53:44,846 --> 00:53:48,265
He might've just said what
he thought at the beginning, you know.

1139
00:53:48,266 --> 00:53:51,560
Anyway, you never know until
you hear what the other party has to say.

1140
00:53:51,561 --> 00:53:53,688
His brain is rotten.

1141
