- That's why I'm so pissed off.

1150
00:54:16,753 --> 00:54:17,963
Hmm.

1151
00:54:20,006 --> 00:54:22,758
So, when it comes to
the graduation ceremony…

1152
00:54:22,759 --> 00:54:23,676
Uh-huh.

1153
00:54:23,677 --> 00:54:26,095
