1163
00:54:52,747 --> 00:54:53,748
Mmm.

1164
00:54:57,919 --> 00:54:59,378
I'm so tired.

1165
00:54:59,379 --> 00:55:01,922
Even if Kamaken changes his attitude,

1166
00:55:01,923 --> 00:55:04,550
you've made up your mind,
