1172
00:55:19,149 --> 00:55:21,108
But I think it's okay to drop out.
I can't do this.

1173
00:55:21,109 --> 00:55:23,902
- I totally get why you feel this way.
- I'm so tired.

1174
00:55:23,903 --> 00:55:25,322
I get it, I really do.

1175
00:55:25,822 --> 00:55:28,782
- But that would be so sad.
- It's okay. I'm tired.

1176
00:55:28,783 --> 00:55:31,201
So, are you okay with this weird feeling
being the last thing?

1177
00:55:31,202 --> 00:55:32,203
Yeah, it's fine.

1178
00:55:33,204 --> 00:55:34,288
That's sad.

1179
00:55:34,289 --> 00:55:36,540
- I'm so tired, I just--
- That's sad.

1180
00:55:36,541 --> 00:55:39,169
- Can I go now?
- No. Just let me finish my smoke.

1181
00:55:40,462 --> 00:55:42,296
- Enough.
- Sit down a second. Sit.

1182
00:55:42,297 --> 00:55:44,715
- No, I'm going now.
- Listen to what I have to say.

1183
00:55:44,716 --> 00:55:47,217
- I listened to you, so listen to me.
- What is it?

1184
00:55:47,218 --> 00:55:49,261
So, sit down, now.

1185
00:55:49,262 --> 00:55:51,181
- Sit down now.
- What is it? What?

1186
00:55:53,433 --> 00:55:55,434
Tell me why you want to drop out.

1187
00:55:55,435 --> 00:55:57,228
Well, I'm tired.

1188
00:55:57,937 --> 00:56:00,857
Why? You know why. I'm tired.

1189
00:56:02,275 --> 00:56:03,567
Look…

1190
00:56:03,568 --> 00:56:05,277
Go talk to him one last time.

1191
00:56:05,278 --> 00:56:08,448
- I don't need to talk to him.
- No, you can't run away like that.

1192
00:56:14,662 --> 00:56:18,082
- I'm going now. Bye.
- Wait-- At least think it through.

1193
00:56:18,083 --> 00:56:20,584
- Promise me you'll think about it.
- No, I've made up my mind.

1194
00:56:20,585 --> 00:56:22,294
Well, think about it again.

1195
00:56:22,295 --> 00:56:25,547
I told you, I've made
my decision. Thank you, Kahochi.

1196
00:56:25,548 --> 00:56:27,633
If you really thought about it,
you wouldn't drop out.

1197
00:56:27,634 --> 00:56:28,760
- Thank you.
- Hey.

1198
00:56:30,053 --> 00:56:33,597
Think about it. Just don't give in
too soon. I'm begging you.

1199
00:56:33,598 --> 00:56:34,849
No, I'm done.

1200
00:56:40,522 --> 00:56:42,065
Hey, what's wrong?

1201
00:56:43,441 --> 00:56:46,026
- He's a grown-up. He's stupid.
- Hey, wait.

1202
00:56:46,027 --> 00:56:46,903
I'm done.

1203
00:56:48,279 --> 00:56:50,114
What? I'm done.

1204
00:56:50,115 --> 00:56:51,574
Come on, don't be like that.

1205
00:56:52,492 --> 00:56:54,243
- Don't be like that.
- I'm done.

1206
00:56:54,244 --> 00:56:55,703
- Don't be like that.
- What?

1207
00:56:56,454 --> 00:56:59,039
Hey. If you have something
to say, let's talk.

1208
00:56:59,040 --> 00:57:01,084
- I'm done. Leave me alone.
- Tell me.

1209
00:57:04,504 --> 00:57:06,713
We've been living together
this whole time.

1210
00:57:06,714 --> 00:57:09,634
We're friends. That means
we'll see this thing through together.

1211
00:57:13,263 --> 00:57:15,097
- Well, how should I put it?
- Mmm-hmm.

1212
00:57:15,098 --> 00:57:17,058
To be honest…

1213
00:57:23,106 --> 00:57:24,983
- I tried my best to get this far.
- Mmm.

1214
00:57:25,483 --> 00:57:27,402
- And I'm crushed again.
- Mmm-hmm.

1215
00:57:41,708 --> 00:57:43,126
I want to go home already.

1216
00:57:49,257 --> 00:57:51,551
I don't have anyone here anymore.

1217
00:57:54,679 --> 00:57:56,638
- Aw.
- Oh, what is happening?

1218
00:57:56,639 --> 00:57:57,848
- What?
- What?

1219
00:57:57,849 --> 00:58:00,517
- I know.
- Next episode's graduation?

1220
00:58:00,518 --> 00:58:02,352
- That's right.
- Yeah.

1221
00:58:02,353 --> 00:58:04,731
What is going on?

1222
00:58:05,315 --> 00:58:07,065
- And it's really ending this time?
- Yes.

1223
00:58:07,066 --> 00:58:09,318
- Next episode won't be four hours' long?
- No, it won't.

1224
00:58:09,319 --> 00:58:11,029
You promise?
